msgid ""
"{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person like?\\p{FONT_MALE}{COLOR"
" DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}MISTY is a TRAINER who's going to\\nkeep "
