"{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}There's a rumor…\\p{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR "
"DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}This cape is a famous date spot.\\pMISTY, the "
"GYM LEADER, has high\\nhopes about this place."
