"{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What does this person do?\\p{COLOR "
"DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}CELADON CITY POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: ERIKA\\lThe "
