msgid ""
"{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}What is this person "
"like?\\p{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}We only use GRASS-"
"type POKéMON at\\nour GYM.\\pWhy? We also use them for making\\nflower "
"arrangements!"
