#. preuve : BPRF 0x1ACC3D (pokefirered gFameCheckerFlavorText_Erika4, BPRE
#. 0x1AE1E5, ptr) : {COLOR 8}{SHADOW 9}POKéMON favoris?\p{FONT 5}{COLOR
