msgid ""
"{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Favorite kind of "
"POKéMON?\\p{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}I would never "
"collect POKéMON if\\nthey were unattractive."
msgstr ""
"{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}Pokémon favoris?\\p{FONT_FEMALE}{COLOR "
"DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Pour ma part, je collectionne les\\nplus beaux "
"Pokémon."

#. source : Rouge Feu FR officiel
#. lot : F_frlg
#. preuve : BPRF 0x1ACC93 (pokefirered gFameCheckerFlavorText_Erika5, BPRE
#. 0x1AE247, ptr) : {COLOR 8}{SHADOW 9}Il y a une rumeur…\p{COLOR 2}{SHADOW
#. 3}Si vous arrivez sans prévenir à\nl’ARENE de CELADOPOLE, \lvous risquez de
#. la voir dormir.
