#. preuve : BPRF 0x1ACD7A (pokefirered gFameCheckerFlavorText_Koga1, BPRE
#. 0x1AE31D, ptr) : {COLOR 8}{SHADOW 9}POKéMON favoris?\p{FONT 4}{COLOR
