msgid ""
"This is a POKéMON JOURNAL from\\nyears ago…\\pPOKéMON JOURNAL\\nCONTEST "
"Special!\\pThe Spring POKéMON CONTEST's\\nGrand Champion is DAISY OAK "
"of\\lPALLET TOWN!"
