msgstr ""
"Moi, je collectionne les Pokémon!\\nTu as un {STR_VAR_1}?\\pTu me l’échanges"
" contre mon\\n{STR_VAR_2}?"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: data/maps/BlackthornCity_House2_hns/scripts.inc:36
#: data/maps/GoldenrodCity_DepartmentStore_6F_hns/scripts.inc:57
#: data/maps/OlivineCity_House1_hns/scripts.inc:36
#: data/maps/VioletCity_House1_hns/scripts.inc:44
msgid "Yay! I got myself {STR_VAR_1}!\\p{STR_VAR_2}, you take care!"
