#: data/maps/GoldenrodCity_DepartmentStore_6F_hns/scripts.inc:65
#: data/maps/Melemele_House_hns/scripts.inc:165
#: data/maps/OlivineCity_House1_hns/scripts.inc:44
#: data/maps/VioletCity_House1_hns/scripts.inc:52
