"one {STR_VAR_2} with {STR_VAR_1}.\\nI know I'm asking a lot…\\pI don't think"
" you'll be willing to,\\nbut may I join you as a partner?"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_2} qui utilise {STR_VAR_1}.\\nJe sais que j’en demande trop…\\pTu "
