msgstr "Merci! Tu as l’esprit sportif!\\nNe bouge pas, je vais nous inscrire?"

#. source : Émeraude FR officiel
#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom/scripts.inc:487
#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerMultiPartnerRoom_hns/scripts.inc:487
msgid "I took time from my busy schedule\\nto be here! Give me a break!"
