#. preuve : BPRF 0x17774C (pokefirered SafariZone_East_Text_AreaSign, BPRE
#. 0x177884, ptr) : PARC 1\nOUEST: PARC CENTRAL
#. ancien (traduction nouvelle) : Zone 1\nOuest: Zone Centrale
#: data/maps/SafariZone_East_Frlg/scripts.inc:25
