msgid "Hey, what? You're throwing me off!\\nHere are some COINS, so shoo!"
msgstr "Hein? Des Jetons? En voilà! Mais…\\nComment dire… Dégage!"

#. source : Rouge Feu FR officiel (adapté)
#. lot : F_frlg
#. preuve : BPRF 0x196226 (pokefirered
#. CeladonCity_GameCorner_Text_Received20CoinsFromMan, BPRE 0x196DF8, ptr) :
