"Your {STR_VAR_1} has grown a lot.\\nYes, quite a lot, I'd say.\\pLet me "
"see…\\nBy level, it's grown by {STR_VAR_2}.\\pAren't I great?"
msgstr ""
"Ton {STR_VAR_1} a bien grandi!\\pIl a {STR_VAR_2} niveau(x)\\nde "
"plus!\\pMerci qui? Hein?"

#. source : Rouge Feu FR officiel
